{"nodes": [{"id": "skills_skills_skills_engineering_improve_codebase_architecture_skill", "label": "Improve Codebase Architecture", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "skills/skills/engineering/improve-codebase-architecture/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Aim is testability and AI-navigability. Scope before you scan (YAGNI) \u2014 weight recently-changed hot spots from commit history. HTML report goes to the OS temp dir so nothing lands in the repo."}, {"id": "skills_skills_skills_engineering_improve_codebase_architecture_skill_deepening_opportunity", "label": "Deepening Opportunity", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "skills/skills/engineering/improve-codebase-architecture/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Refactors that turn shallow modules into deep ones, found by exploring where understanding requires bouncing between small modules."}, {"id": "skills_skills_skills_engineering_improve_codebase_architecture_skill_deletion_test", "label": "Deletion Test", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "skills/skills/engineering/improve-codebase-architecture/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Would deleting the module concentrate complexity, or just move it? A 'yes, concentrates' answer is the signal for a deepening opportunity."}, {"id": "skills_skills_skills_engineering_improve_codebase_architecture_skill_codebase_design", "label": "Codebase Design", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "skills/skills/engineering/improve-codebase-architecture/SKILL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Provides the shared architecture vocabulary (module, interface, depth, seam, adapter, leverage, locality) and princip